-- An unsigned value `main` whose type only another binding's use determines:
-- `helper` would ground `main` at `List Int`, but that use is rejected, so no
-- verb reaches the unrouted dictionary the wrapped program would leave.
-- Hand-derived: REJECT on all three verbs, at the use of `main` in `helper`.
idf : a -> a
idf x = x
main = idf []
helper = 1 :: main
